{
  "bodyHash": "1C3kjc2Flas=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 模組，滿懷愛意製作。大量支援 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 的活躍模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p><h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">雙重門（Double Doors）是一款極簡風格的模組，可讓相同的雙扇門、活板門和柵欄門同時開啟。只需點擊任一扇（木）門，或透過單一壓力板或按鈕即可觸發。預設情況下，此模組也會搜尋其他相連的門類方塊並一併開啟，最遠可達10個方塊。此功能可在設定中開關。村民也能開啟雙扇門！<br><br>蹲下時會關閉雙門功能，僅開啟或關閉單一方塊。<br><br></span><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>如要讓柵欄門和活板門「雙雙」開啟，請務必在設定中啟用！</strong><br><br></span></p><h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"相依性\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/rpg-bundle.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum's RPG Bundle\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableRecursiveOpening</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否啟用遞迴開啟功能。啟用後，例如可用活板門建造一扇巨型門，只要彼此相連，就能同時開啟。'recursiveOpeningMaxBlocksDistance' 設定選項控制功能的搜尋範圍。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>recursiveOpeningMaxBlocksDistance</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 10，最小值 1，最大值 32</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用 'enableRecursiveOpening' 時，遞迴函式應搜尋多少個方塊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableDoors</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用時，模組會作用於雙扇門。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableFenceGates</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用時，模組會作用於雙扇柵欄門。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableTrapdoors</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用時，模組會作用於雙扇活板門。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableModIncompatibilityCheck</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">檢查是否有其他模組也搭載了雙門功能。若發現，則在其設定中編輯一行以關閉雙門。修復因程式碼重複執行而導致門無法開啟的問題。</span><br><br></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>適用於所有雙門配置，也能遞迴作用於其他所有方塊！</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/double-doors/a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"332\"><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>任何相連的門類方塊都會被遞迴搜尋並開啟：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/double-doors/b.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"846\" height=\"472\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;<br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>預設情況下，遞迴函式會開啟 10 個方塊以外的方塊，但可透過 'recursiveOpeningMaxBlocksDistance' 設定更改：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/double-doors/c.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"846\" height=\"472\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>點擊兩扇門中的任何一扇，另一扇也會同時開啟：</span></strong><br></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/double-doors/d.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"848\" height=\"428\"></p>\n</div><p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>用單一按鈕開啟鐵門，或其他任何配置。</strong></span></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/double-doors/e.webp\" alt=\"gif1\" width=\"1000\" height=\"506\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>適用於上下疊放的活板門和柵欄門，可透過點擊或壓力板/按鈕觸發。</strong></span></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/double-doors/f.webp\" alt=\"gif2\" width=\"1000\" height=\"506\"></p>\n</div><p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>村民也能開啟雙扇門！</strong></span></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/double-doors/h.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>您可以在任何模組包中自由使用此模組，只要下載檔案仍託管於 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內即可。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 包含所有可用模組的總覽與更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">留言功能已關閉，因為我無法在眾多分開的模組頁面上追蹤留言。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，請移至&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 儲存庫</a>。感謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
